		<td width="150" align="left" valign="top" class="row1"><span class="name"><a name="15997"></a><b>Nabastin Earthguard</b></span><br /><span class="postdetails">Guest<br /><br /><br /><br /><br /></span><br /></td>
		<td class="row1" width="100%" height="28" valign="top"><table width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0">
			<tr>
				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=15997&amp;sid=2372f2317deeec3613705eea172117d5#15997"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Sun Oct 27, 2002 10:35 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=15997&amp;sid=2372f2317deeec3613705eea172117d5"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">A bright gleaming sword is drawn and polished. The gnome holding it checks the edges and hilt for any damage or wear. Satisfied that it is in order, he replaces it in its scabard. Picking up his worn tunic, sighing as he puts it on, and thinks to himself "This tunic is not very knight like but i will change it into a suit of armor. This is Brell's wishes and my duty." Straping his shield to his arm, he glances at the mirror to see if he has changed any. Noting that he has gotten a bit older, but nothing that isnt major, he nods and walks out of the room. Coming down the stairs, clumping all the way, Nabastin sits down at the bar in the tavern and orders a drink. He glances around and nods to himself. "Yes, it is good to have a home here with friends."  
<br />
Brell Serilis has given me the duty and power to protect the earth. The earth shall protect me in return.<i></i></span><span class="gentblsmall"></span></td>
			</tr>
