				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=16001&amp;sid=2372f2317deeec3613705eea172117d5#16001"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Mon Oct 28, 2002 7:50 am<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=16001&amp;sid=2372f2317deeec3613705eea172117d5"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Marcelas looks over at the noise coming from the stairs.  <i>Is someone bouncing a ball down those stairs? In here?</i>Then he sees the Gnome reach the bottom step and head for the bar for a drink.  He moves and takes a seat beside him.  Smiling warmly, he extends a hand to shake, "Good to have you with us Nabastin.  I'm Marc.  Let me know if you have any questions."
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
/ooc drop me an email <a href="mailto:jimmy@pico-consulting.com">jimmy@pico-consulting.com</a> and I'll get you on the newsletter that I need to start sending out again. <img src="images/smiles/icon_smile.gif" alt="icon_smile.gif" border="0" /> 
<br />
Marcelas Hiddenstrike
<br />

<br />
Scout of the Concordat
