			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Lanturias beams a smile at the gnome, and waves Indalis over. &quot;Please, Indalis, get our newcomer whatever drinks he likes, and put it on my tab.&quot; Lanturias looks over to Nabastin and smiles heartily &quot;And sir, let me welcome you again to the Concordat.&quot; 
