				<td width="100%"><a href="viewtopic.php?p=16005&amp;sid=2372f2317deeec3613705eea172117d5#16005"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/icon_minipost.gif" width="12" height="9" alt="Post" title="Post" border="0" /></a><span class="postdetails">Posted: Mon Oct 28, 2002 8:49 pm<span class="gen">&nbsp;</span>&nbsp; &nbsp;Post subject: </span></td>
				<td valign="top" align="right" nowrap="nowrap"><a href="posting.php?mode=quote&amp;p=16005&amp;sid=2372f2317deeec3613705eea172117d5"><img src="templates/Chronicles/images/lang_english/icon_quote.gif" alt="Reply with quote" title="Reply with quote" border="0" /></a>   </td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><hr /></td>
			</tr>
			<tr>
				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">Mibblebik, the gnomish warrior, clad in his several colors of plate armor, is passed out on the tavern floor and gets sweeped up into a dustpan as a joke. The bartender sets the gnome back on the floor and the grin on his face fades. Mibblebik sneezes and wakes with a start, and rubs the dust off his helmet goggles. &quot;Huh? Oy, too many Gnomish Spirits...&quot; Mibblebik stands up and staggers a bit, and looks about, to see what has changed. He sees the gnomish knight and a wide grin spreads across his face. &quot;Gnomish Brodder!&quot; Mibblebik charges over and gives Nabastin a bear hug, obviously ignoring the horribly surprised look on Nabastin's face. Nabastin motions to Marcelas as if to say &quot;Does this happen often?&quot;. Mibblebik sets him down and shakes off the remaining dust.
<br />

<br />

<br />

<br />
Mibblebik Ishkebibble
<br />

<br />
Gnomish Warrior of the 24th Battle  
